name gfnotation
category Package
revision 37156
shortdesc Typeset Gottlob Frege's notation in plain TeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package implements macros for plain TeX to typeset the
longdesc notation invented by Gottlob Frege in 1879 for his books
longdesc "Begriffsschrift" and "Grundgesetze der Arithmetik" (two
longdesc volumes). The output styles of both books are supported.
